{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はクリスマス！りんりんりーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日に引き続き\nサンクエトワールのイベントでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/25/5023629/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りんりんりーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装もセトリも2日とも違いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は\n『大人への近道』の衣装 クリスマスver."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\n乃木坂の白いクリスマス衣装に白いサンタ帽"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンタエトワールいかがでした？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/25/5023629/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"OVERTURE\n大人への近道\n-MC-\n気づいたら片想い\nガールズルール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お気づきの方もいると思いますが\n1曲ずつセンターが違ったのです＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人への近道→未央奈\n制服のマネキン(24日)→きいちゃん\nおいでシャンプー(24日)→中田\n気づいたら片想い(25日)→蘭世\nガールズルール(25日)→ひめたん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日以上に\n本当にたくさんの方が来てくださってて\nもうびっくりでした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に来てくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/25/5023629/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イルミネーション素敵すぎて\nサイリウムも光ってて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああクリスマスにライブできてる今\n本当に幸せだ\nって思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/25/5023629/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い中、待たせちゃったよね？\n風邪ひかないように気をつけてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/25/5023629/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい楽しい2日間だった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"あなたに一番近い星\"らしく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"距離感の近くて\nキラキラしたイベントだったかなと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/25/5023629/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/25/5023629/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は名古屋全握！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宿題ですよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/25/5023629/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までのMVで一番好きなものは何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/12/25/5023629/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何鍋が好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めましてとか\n生駒ちゃんの推しとか\nいっぱいループしてとかで\n中田となに話したらいいかわからないかたは\n答えてください(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ち物チェック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"□全国握手券(応募券部分を切り